<test-user-switch/>
<view class="page join safe-bottom"><text class="eyebrow">JOIN ROOM</text><view class="title">找到你的座位</view><view class="subtitle">输入房间号，从自己的手机加入现场对局。</view><view class="join-card card"><text class="label">6 位房间号</text><input class="code" type="number" maxlength="6" value="{{code}}" placeholder="000000" placeholder-class="placeholder" bindinput="codeInput"/><text class="label">房间密码</text><input class="input" password maxlength="8" placeholder="如房间未设置可留空" placeholder-class="placeholder" bindinput="passwordInput"/><button class="primary submit" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">{{submitting ? '加入中…' : '加入房间'}}</button></view><view class="notice">加入后请选择自己的座位并准备。每位玩家均需使用自己的微信进入房间。</view></view>
